{"2979470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retail Revenge", "steam_appid": 2979470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in and take control of a supermarket built for hands-on PC VR. Stock shelves, set prices, scan and bag groceries, serve customers and keep the checkout moving. When the pressure builds, you decide whether to stay professional—or fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/3ce4f03f2ace22ee4ea25349c93dbcb9.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR checkout gameplay with a customer waiting while the player scans groceries.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/3ce4f03f2ace22ee4ea25349c93dbcb9.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN THE STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle the everyday jobs of retail using motion-controlled VR interactions. Move products, restock displays, set prices, scan items, bag groceries and process customers at the checkout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/16aa8d88975e8ef0ab3e62e6cd1efd74.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR player lifting a crate of peaches while stocking the supermarket produce section.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/16aa8d88975e8ef0ab3e62e6cd1efd74.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEAL WITH CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers fill the store, gather at the checkout and bring their own attitude. Keep the service moving, manage the pressure and try to survive another shift.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OR FIGHT BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retail Revenge turns workplace frustration into physical VR chaos. Pick up a weapon and fight back when customer service is no longer the option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/0c727ea0ca1464b274d4b0a8ee34bad9.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR combat with a baseball bat during a chaotic supermarket shift.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/0c727ea0ca1464b274d4b0a8ee34bad9.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the supermarket seriously, cause chaos or move between both styles during the same shift. How you deal with the customers is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retail Revenge enters Early Access with its core supermarket and combat experience playable. Development will continue with community feedback focused on expanding the game, improving its systems and refining balance, performance and polish.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in and take control of a supermarket built for hands-on PC VR. Stock shelves, set prices, scan and bag groceries, serve customers and keep the checkout moving. When the pressure builds, you decide whether to stay professional—or fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/3ce4f03f2ace22ee4ea25349c93dbcb9.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR checkout gameplay with a customer waiting while the player scans groceries.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/3ce4f03f2ace22ee4ea25349c93dbcb9.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN THE STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle the everyday jobs of retail using motion-controlled VR interactions. Move products, restock displays, set prices, scan items, bag groceries and process customers at the checkout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/16aa8d88975e8ef0ab3e62e6cd1efd74.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR player lifting a crate of peaches while stocking the supermarket produce section.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/16aa8d88975e8ef0ab3e62e6cd1efd74.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEAL WITH CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers fill the store, gather at the checkout and bring their own attitude. Keep the service moving, manage the pressure and try to survive another shift.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OR FIGHT BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retail Revenge turns workplace frustration into physical VR chaos. Pick up a weapon and fight back when customer service is no longer the option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras/0c727ea0ca1464b274d4b0a8ee34bad9.avif?t=1788276648\" alt=\"First-person VR combat with a baseball bat during a chaotic supermarket shift.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979470/extras_big/0c727ea0ca1464b274d4b0a8ee34bad9.webp?t=1788276648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap